# Component Size Limit

- Hard limit: a component file must stay at or below 180 lines.
- Prefer extraction over growth: split long files into focused subcomponents, hooks, or helpers.
- Keep each extracted module single-purpose and easy to test.
- Reuse shared UI primitives and utilities instead of duplicating markup or state logic.

## Refactor Pattern

```tsx
// ❌ Too large: one file handles layout, desktop nav, mobile nav, and state.
// ✅ Better: keep container component small and extract:
// - header.desktop-nav.tsx
// - header.mobile-nav.tsx
// - header.brand.tsx
```
